,"This fixture tests only customer lookup. Use full resource fixtures for other\noperations; SDK types do not validate them at runtime.",[965,966,968],"h2",{"id":967},"test-your-storage-boundary","Test your storage boundary",[472,970,971,972,976,977,709],{},"Check the ",[973,974,975],"a",{"href":296},"storage contracts",": uniqueness under concurrency,\ntest\u002Flive separation, omitted versus null updates, and a declined ",[476,978,979],{},"store",[472,981,982,983,986],{},"For ",[973,984,985],{"href":314},"webhooks",", test valid, invalid, stale, and rotated signatures\nusing an independent HMAC signer. Concurrent copies must commit once. A failed\nreaction must roll back rows, audit markers, and outbox work, then succeed on retry.\nAlso test unknown events and out-of-order snapshots. Keep timestamp checks enabled.",[965,988,990],{"id":989},"live-test-mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[992,993,994,1006,1012,1027],"ol",{},[995,996,997,998,1001,1002,1005],"li",{},"Set ",[476,999,1000],{},"VATLY_API_KEY"," to a real ",[476,1003,1004],{},"test_"," key. Use customer and catalogue IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[995,1007,1008,1009,709],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[476,1010,1011],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[995,1013,1014,1015,1018,1019,1022,1023,1026],{},"Pay through a ",[973,1016,1017],{"href":302},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[476,1020,1021],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[476,1024,1025],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[995,1028,1029],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[472,1031,1032,1035,1036,1039,1040,635,1043,1039,1046,1039,1049,1052,1053,1056,1057,1060],{},[476,1033,1034],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[476,1037,1038],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[476,1041,1042],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[476,1044,1045],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[476,1047,1048],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[476,1050,1051],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[476,1054,1055],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[476,1058,1059],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[965,1062,1064],{"id":1063},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[472,1066,1067],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[472,1069,1070,1071,1077,1078,709],{},"See the ",[973,1072,1076],{"href":1073,"rel":1074},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1075],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[973,1079,1082],{"href":1080,"rel":1081},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1075],"Test Helpers API reference",[1084,1085,1086],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{-